    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "今天晚上我们试试少看手机怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "可以。你怎么突然想到这个？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "昨天我发现自己一小时看了很多次手机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你是在等消息吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "没有，就是习惯了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "那我们把手机放到那边。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果有重要电话怎么办？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "铃声开着就可以，不用一直拿在手里。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好。那我们先喝茶聊天。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你今天工作有什么有意思的事吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有，王明教了我一个整理任务的方法。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "听起来你越来越适应工作了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "是。这样面对面聊，比发消息舒服。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "我也觉得。有时候手机让人一直分心。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "已经半小时了，我都没想拿手机。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "说明没你想的那么难。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以后每周试两个晚上怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "好，只要别变成新的压力就行。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk2_sc019_word_001.m4a",
